{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794020/extras/TheBall.png?t=1751544692\" /></div>This game is something that you have never played before, something that can surprise you with its uniqueness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ball \u2014 it can surprise you with its unique design and unique level construction. In them you will find activators, teleporters, satellites, mobile platforms and unique scenery.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794020/extras/Locations.png?t=1751544692\" /></div><strong>Locations:</strong> <br>26 levels with different uniqueness and linear progression. Each location will meet you with colors, and the paths can be difficult, consisting of several tasks, do not forget that this is a puzzle and also a maze.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794020/extras/Complexity.png?t=1751544692\" /></div><strong>Complexity:</strong> <br>Do not worry, all levels are moderately complicated, and the difficulty increases as you play. You will be greeted by a simple interface, clear training that clearly shows what is responsible for what.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794020/extras/End.png?t=1751544692\" /></div><strong>End:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To reach the end, you should look for activators, teleporters, all of them lead to your goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794020/extras/Colorfulness.png?t=1751544692\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"